   1:Source/ui/home_page.c **** /*
   2:Source/ui/home_page.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — home_page.c
   3:Source/ui/home_page.c ****  * Start page / speed dial (port of Source/ui/home_page.lua). See home_page.h.
   4:Source/ui/home_page.c ****  * All geometry, navigation quirks (2-column grid with row wrap, settings
   5:Source/ui/home_page.c ****  * button at index 0), crank scrolling (×1.5, invertCrank flips), smooth
   6:Source/ui/home_page.c ****  * scroll (0.3 factor, 0.5 snap), auto-scroll-to-selection, comet logo,
   7:Source/ui/home_page.c ****  * address bar pill, and per-card oscillating marquee (speed 50, dwell 1s,
   8:Source/ui/home_page.c ****  * clip 15px) preserved from the reference.
   9:Source/ui/home_page.c ****  */
